       "[[anó|other]]",
       "what",
       "Anó ba ang pangálan ninyó? *What is your name?*"
      ],
      [
       "[[alín|other]]",
       "which",
       "Alín ba ang iyóng gustó? *Which do you like?*"
      ],
      [
       "[[gaáno|other]]",
       "how",
       "Gaáno kalakí ang Pilipinas? *How large is the Philippines?*"
      ],
      [
       "[[paáno|other]]",
       "how",
