     "title": "Remember",
     "items": [
      "There are 14 question words, from síno (who) to sa kaníno (with/to whom).",
      "Gaáno: degree or quality. Paáno: a process. Nasaán: a person or thing. Saán: an action.",
      "Double a question word for the plural: alín-alín, sinu-síno, kaní-kanino, anu-anó.",
      "Nasaán and bakit are never doubled.",
      "Iyán and itó shorten to 'yan and 'to: Síno 'yan? Kaníno 'to?"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "vocab",
     "group": "more",
     "title": "More words from this lesson"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
